\ Dogfood: Phase 4 Slice 5a (R24). The words half of the two-file library:
\ componentwise `point-add` and squared length `len2` over `point::Point`,
\ imported by type from `examples/modules_point.sth` and exported for
\ `examples/modules.sth` to call qualified.

import: "modules_point.sth" point | Point | ;

: point-add ( Point Point -- Point )
  | a b |
  &a &x @ &b &x @ add
  &a &y @ &b &y @ add
  Point ;

: len2 ( Point -- i64 )
  | p |
  &p &x @ &p &x @ mul
  &p &y @ &p &y @ mul
  add ;

export: point-add len2 ;
